{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/fb80ccc7461a87e21daf63e3d601bc4a.avif?t=1768418753\" width=1560 height=248 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Condemned: No Scape</strong> is a love letter to the golden age of the Game Boy, but with the brutal precision of modern platformers. You wake up in a forgotten prison, with no memories and only one goal: escape. But the exit isn't just a door\u2026 it's a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/4f6eb1caea5015dcaf247a1a408e4619.poster.avif?t=1768418753\" width=400 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/4f6eb1caea5015dcaf247a1a408e4619.webm?t=1768418753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/4f6eb1caea5015dcaf247a1a408e4619.mp4?t=1768418753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/c9f8fbc2dc6f8dc982f4d6312d7475a4.avif?t=1768418753\" width=1560 height=248 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forget luck. Here, every pixel counts.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight Controls:</strong> Physics designed to respond instantly to your reflexes. If you die, it's on you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Environment is Your Enemy:</strong> Crumbling platforms, invisible spikes, and traps that demand perfect timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Respawn:</strong> Died? Try again immediately. Frustration is part of the learning process.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/8cae33d463ee04ba6fbb2239b68c1716.poster.avif?t=1768418753\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/8cae33d463ee04ba6fbb2239b68c1716.webm?t=1768418753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/8cae33d463ee04ba6fbb2239b68c1716.mp4?t=1768418753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/03a9988851067c02b5573ccd9a1dfc3b.avif?t=1768418753\" width=1560 height=248 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlike other games in the genre, your journey isn't empty.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your actions and discoveries define the protagonist's fate. Will you just run, or will you uncover the truth?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Lore:</strong> Find documents and clues scattered across the map to understand who built this place and why you are here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/98762914d357c25be45e591c73045a6b.avif?t=1768418753\" width=521 height=396 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 