onstant tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Environments:</strong> Hidden secrets that encourage exploration and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Challenge:</strong> Making every new level more engaging and rewarding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >75 Levels divided into 3 Acts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Game Modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Areas to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD Cutscenes &amp; Voice Acting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native Speedrun Mode.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307350?t=1768418753","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307350?t=1768418753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/1bd463e132319c672cfdecab3b0521b544d87328/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768418753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/1bd463e132319c672cfdecab3b0521b544d87328/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768418753","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3346380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":